#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:5 1e8b43083b2e4bf9a51a1d3f701efeca
msgid "Installing Ground Station (GCS) software"
msgstr "安装地面站（GCS）软件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:7 82456be563c442cf92e03a4660db7b3d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot can be used with :ref:`many different ground stations <common-"
"choosing-a-ground-station>`."
msgstr "ArduPilot 可与 :ref:`多种地面站 <common-choosing-a-ground-station>` 配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:9 8c1df6c99b9848db8f452c54362d0dbc
msgid ""
"Developers typically use a *desktop* GCS, as these tend to provide deeper "
"access to vehicle setup parameters and advanced debugging features. If you "
"just want to fly you may instead choose to use a GCS running on a mobile OS "
"(iOS, Android)."
msgstr ""
"开发人员通常使用 **桌面** "
"地面站，因为这类软件通常提供更深入的飞行器参数设置和高级调试功能。如果只是用于飞行，也可以选择运行在移动操作系统（iOS、Android）上的地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:12
#: 3f844bdcf6984b0fa1d306d6458cb61a
msgid ""
"Installation links for some of the more popular GCS systems are provided "
"below:"
msgstr "以下提供了一些常用地面站系统的安装链接："

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:14
#: 63cc078950c745e6b017c8394c2a43a3
msgid ""
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` (Windows, Linux, Android): "
":ref:`Install Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>` This GCS is"
" the most compatible and closely tracks new features and updates in "
"ArduPilot. It is recommended for first-time users and power users alike.  It"
" functions best in the Windows environment."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` （Windows、Linux、Android）：:ref:`安装 "
"Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>`。该地面站与 ArduPilot "
"新功能和更新的兼容性最好，功能紧跟最新进展。推荐新用户和高级用户使用，在 Windows 环境下表现最佳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:16
#: 3e52600b92c9405dadb796271582da9f
msgid ""
"`QGroundControl <http://qgroundcontrol.com/>`__ (Windows, Mac OS X, Linux, "
"Android and iOS).This is the most popular GCS for Android based systems and "
"provides the best presentation on small format devices like cellphones. Does"
" not have all the capabilities of Mission Planner, but has a more user-"
"friendly interface for some functions. Operates well on all platforms"
msgstr ""
"`QGroundControl <http://qgroundcontrol.com/>`__ （Windows、Mac OS "
"X、Linux、Android 和 iOS）。这是最流行的 Android 地面站，在手机等小屏幕设备上显示效果最佳。功能不如Mission "
"Planner全面，但某些功能界面更友好，在所有平台上均运行良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:18
#: 978a87126e1a4c6bbecef2956adbe0cc
msgid ""
"`Download and Install "
"<https://docs.qgroundcontrol.com/en/getting_started/download_and_install.html>`__"
" (stable)"
msgstr ""
"`下载和安装 "
"<https://docs.qgroundcontrol.com/en/getting_started/download_and_install.html>`__"
" （稳定版）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:19
#: d98ce94a3c904c88b3c279dba5918acb
msgid ""
"`Daily builds "
"<https://docs.qgroundcontrol.com/en/releases/daily_builds.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`每日构建版 <https://docs.qgroundcontrol.com/en/releases/daily_builds.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:21
#: e29d6f29983743819866d513b44b8c7d
msgid ""
":ref:`APM Planner 2 <planner2:home>` (Windows, Mac OS X, Linux): "
":ref:`Install APM Planner 2 <planner2:installing-apm-planner-2>` -Provides "
"basic functionality, but is not currently well maintained and updated."
msgstr ""
":ref:`APM Planner 2 <planner2:home>` （Windows、Mac OS X、Linux）：:ref:`安装 APM "
"Planner 2 <planner2:installing-apm-planner-2>` ——提供基本功能，但目前维护和更新不够及时。"
